---
apiVersion: kuttl.dev/v1beta1
kind: TestAssert
# Detection latency = lease staleness window (LEASE_DURATION_SECONDS = 30s) + the operator's re-check
# requeue (~20s), so allow a generous timeout.
timeout: 300
---
# The operator surfaced AgentUnavailable on the KafkaCluster status once the agent's Lease went stale.
# Asserted as a resource stanza (subset match) rather than a jsonpath command, so kuttl polls it
# SILENTLY — no per-retry command echo in the log.
apiVersion: kafka.stackable.tech/v1alpha1
kind: KafkaCluster
metadata:
  name: test-kafka
status:
  agent:
    available: false
